contratos/*
!contratos/preenchidos
contratos/preenchidos/*
!contratos/preenchidos/GABARITO.json

# ferramentas python de preparo dos PDFs
tools/
tasks/
docs/
*.md
!README.md

# ambiente local
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
.playwright-mcp/
